      so this is a straight scale-around-center: pivot = content center,
      translate = (54,54) minus that same center after scaling collapses
      to zero offset. Scale 0.14 keeps the grid's corner tiles safely
      within the ~66dp safe-zone circle that survives every launcher
      mask shape - verified empirically against a circle-mask preview
      rather than trusting the arithmetic alone (an earlier 0.172 value
      sat right at the edge with no real margin).
